# Files intentionally not tracked by Git.
# This file is in the public domain.
#
# Ignore all subdirectories.
*/
#
# Ignore non-directories that are the output of builds,
# or are backups or nonces unlikely to be added to the repository.
*.a
*.asc
*.bak
*.ck
*.core
*.diff
*.i
*.o
*.orig
*.out
*.patch
*.pdf
*.ps
*.rej
*.s
*.t
*.tar
*.tar.*
*.txt
*.tzs
*.zi
*~
.*
!.gitignore
ChangeLog
core
core.*
date
leapseconds
tzdir.h
tzselect
version
version.h
zdump
zic

# Fork additions: the Zig package, its tests, fixtures, tools and CI.  The
# upstream rules above deliberately ignore every subdirectory and every
# dotfile, which would hide these paths from Git and from Zig's package
# hashing, so they are re-included explicitly.
!*/
!.github/
!src/
!include/
!test/
!test/data/
!consumer/
!consumer/data/
!tools/
!test/data/*.zi
!consumer/data/*.zi

# Build outputs of this fork (re-ignored after the negations above).
.zig-cache/
zig-out/
